The project templates in this folder, and every file `factoria new` copies or writes into a new game from them
(scenes, scripts, prefabs, assets, tests, tools, README.md, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, types/, ...), are licensed under
the MIT No Attribution License (MIT-0) below, not under the MIT License of the rest of FactorIA: a game made from
them owes nothing to FactorIA for these files, not even a notice.

A game exported with `factoria export` also contains the FactorIA runtime, which is MIT-licensed and includes
third-party code; the export writes FACTORIA_NOTICES.txt with those licenses next to the game (docs/EXPORTING.md).

